  <text>
    <body>
      <p>Patrick J. Welshe is listed as the proprietor of the <ref target="civic?id=New%20Haymarket%20hotel">New Haymarket Hotel</ref> at 26 Sydney Road in the directories in 1910 and 1915.</p>
      <p>The directories still list him at 26 Sydney Road in 1920 and 1925, after the hotel itself is no longer listed.</p>
      <p>See also <ref target="civic?id=New%20Haymarket%20hotel">New Haymarket Hotel</ref> and <ref target="civic?id=Hotels">Hotels</ref>.</p>
    </body>
